@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
title 实验三 实际类与持久化边界
class User {
 id: str
 username: str
 role: str
 status: str
 from_row(row)
 to_dict()
}
class Product {
 id: str
 seller_id: str
 status: str
 version: int
 price_cents: int
 from_row(row)
}
class Reservation {
 id: str
 product_id: str
 buyer_id: str
 price_snapshot: int
 status: str
 from_row(row)
}
class AuthService {
 register(data)
 login(data)
 disable(actor, user, reason)
}
class ProductService {
 create(actor, data)
 submit(actor, product, version)
 review(actor, review, decision)
}
class TradingService {
 reserve(actor, product, key)
 cancel_or_reject(...)
 confirm(...)
 complete(...)
}
class GovernanceService {
 report(...)
 moderate(...)
 decide_close(...)
}
class QueryService {
 products(actor, filters)
 statistics(actor, filters)
}
class Repository {
 actor(id)
 admin(id)
 get(table, id)
 active_reservation(product)
}
class Database {
 connect()
 transaction()
 backup(destination)
}
User "1" -- "0..*" Product : 卖家
User "1" -- "0..*" Reservation : 买家
Product "1" -- "0..*" Reservation : 历史预约
AuthService ..> User
ProductService ..> Product
TradingService ..> Reservation
AuthService ..> Repository
ProductService ..> Repository
TradingService ..> Repository
GovernanceService ..> Repository
QueryService ..> Repository
Repository ..> Database
note bottom of Product
完整字段和其他持久对象见schema.sql。
金额使用整数分；有效预约由部分唯一索引限制。
end note
@enduml
